1
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,180
Hioki.

2
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:43,470
Back in my junior year,

3
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,800
I didn't have any friends in my new class,

4
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:50,980
and ended up in a group I
wasn't close to for the school trip.

5
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:53,370
For the very first time in my life,

6
00:00:53,650 --> 00:00:54,850
I got a boyfriend.

7
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:58,030
Since then,

8
00:00:58,570 --> 00:00:59,770
two months have passed,

9
00:01:07,163 --> 00:01:10,483
and we've started our senior year.

10
00:01:11,730 --> 00:01:12,730
Watarai.

11
00:01:13,190 --> 00:01:15,780
- Hey, don't leave me behind!
- Oh, my bad.

12
00:01:16,110 --> 00:01:17,680
I just couldn't wait to see Hioki.

13
00:01:18,250 --> 00:01:20,050
Watarai and Morisaki are in Class 5.

14
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:22,700
Don't you two see each other every day?

15
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:26,250
Hioki, let's get going. I'm starving.

16
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:28,510
Hotta and Nakasato are in Class 3.

17
00:01:30,430 --> 00:01:31,530
And I'm in Class 2.

18
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:34,920
Wait up, Hioki! Come on, don't ditch me!

19
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,210
Look over there, a total knockout!

20
00:01:37,570 --> 00:01:39,210
- Where?! - Let's go.

21
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:40,720
Yeah, let's go.

22
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:44,670
It's a bummer we're
in different classes now,

23
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:49,060
but we still naturally
hang out all the time.

24
00:02:15,730 --> 00:02:16,790
What's up?

25
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,540
Sorry to bug you during club practice.

26
00:02:19,300 --> 00:02:20,300
Um...

27
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:22,510
I was hoping we could walk home together.

28
00:02:23,590 --> 00:02:24,590
Sure.

29
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:27,840
Watarai and I have been
dating for two months now.

30
00:02:28,100 --> 00:02:29,100
Oh,

31
00:02:29,930 --> 00:02:31,696
I still have about an hour
left, though. Is that okay?

32
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:33,220
Yeah, totally fine.

33
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,080
I'd wait as many hours as it takes.

34
00:02:38,170 --> 00:02:39,410
I am your boyfriend, after all.

35
00:02:44,190 --> 00:02:45,790
Things are still going great between us.

36
00:02:47,450 --> 00:02:48,450
By the way,

37
00:02:49,330 --> 00:02:51,290
you look so cool during practice, Hioki.

38
00:02:57,290 --> 00:02:58,390
I really love seeing it.

39
00:03:00,250 --> 00:03:01,670
Hold on...

40
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,180
We're at school right now.

41
00:03:03,630 --> 00:03:06,180
So it's okay as long
as we're not at school?

42
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:09,850
Well, of course...

43
00:03:10,850 --> 00:03:11,600
Just how far can we go?

44
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:12,640
Huh?

45
00:03:16,970 --> 00:03:18,170
Since I'm your boyfriend,

46
00:03:19,270 --> 00:03:21,150
does that mean I can do
whatever I want to you?

47
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:30,050
Just kidding.

48
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:33,740
Anyway, have a good practice.

49
00:03:35,910 --> 00:03:36,910
Yeah.

50
00:03:37,270 --> 00:03:39,570
Hey! Hioki!

51
00:03:40,110 --> 00:03:43,810
Quit flirting with Mr. Handsome
and get back over here!

52
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:46,146
I'll be right out as soon as
we're done. Wait for me, okay?

53
00:03:46,170 --> 00:03:48,146
- Okay, I'll be waiting.
- Hey, what kind of promise is that?!

54
00:03:48,170 --> 00:03:50,940
What are you two making secret
promises behind my back for?

55
00:03:50,970 --> 00:03:53,340
Back to practice! Come on, hustle!

56
00:03:58,090 --> 00:03:59,090
How's your new class?

57
00:03:59,570 --> 00:04:00,570
Settling in okay?

58
00:04:01,370 --> 00:04:02,370
Yeah...

59
00:04:03,450 --> 00:04:05,290
It's pretty fun. Tsujitani's
in my class, too.

60
00:04:06,810 --> 00:04:08,110
- Oh, really? - Yeah.

61
00:04:09,610 --> 00:04:10,930
Everything's okay, though, right?

62
00:04:11,450 --> 00:04:13,070
Nobody's getting too close to you?

63
00:04:13,610 --> 00:04:14,610
Huh?

64
00:04:14,950 --> 00:04:19,010
Like chatting you up all
the time or getting handsy.

65
00:04:19,950 --> 00:04:21,150
No, nothing like that.

66
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:24,120
What about guys like me?

67
00:04:24,210 --> 00:04:25,220
Definitely not.

68
00:04:25,820 --> 00:04:27,650
Honestly, you worry way too much.

69
00:04:29,030 --> 00:04:30,030
Well, I can't help it...

70
00:04:30,380 --> 00:04:32,000
You're just so cute, Hioki.

71
00:04:32,890 --> 00:04:33,990
Uh, well...

72
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:38,120
Pretty sure you're the only
one who thinks that, Watarai...

73
00:04:41,190 --> 00:04:42,190
Good. Keep it that way.

74
00:04:55,550 --> 00:04:56,750
- Oh!
- Hm?

75
00:04:57,330 --> 00:04:59,010
Watarai, what are you gonna do about this?

76
00:04:59,900 --> 00:05:00,900
Hm?

77
00:05:12,890 --> 00:05:13,890
This thing.

78
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:16,589
Oh, the study camp.

79
00:05:16,590 --> 00:05:18,976
(An overnight camp will be held to
give everyone plenty of time to study.)

80
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,900
Yeah, I was planning on going...

81
00:05:22,490 --> 00:05:25,590
If you're going, Hioki, I'll go anywhere.

82
00:05:29,660 --> 00:05:33,580
Come to think of it, have you
decided on a college yet, Watarai?

83
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:36,390
Not yet.

84
00:05:37,530 --> 00:05:39,050
As long as I can be with you, Hioki,

85
00:05:39,490 --> 00:05:40,690
I don't care where I go.

86
00:05:41,100 --> 00:05:43,620
Don't you think you should put
a little more thought into that?

87
00:05:44,450 --> 00:05:46,169
Still, I can't wait.

88
00:05:46,170 --> 00:05:47,170
For the camp.

89
00:05:47,620 --> 00:05:49,890
- Yeah.
- Feels just like our school trip.

90
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:50,960
It really does.

91
00:05:53,070 --> 00:05:55,070
I wonder if we'll get to sleep together.

92
00:05:55,870 --> 00:05:57,270
Uh, I don't think...

93
00:05:58,450 --> 00:06:00,610
Why not? Don't you want
to share a bed with me, Hioki?

94
00:06:00,630 --> 00:06:05,400
No, I want to, too, but
we're in different classes.

95
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:07,320
I'll figure something out.

96
00:06:07,390 --> 00:06:08,670
There's no way that's happening.

97
00:06:10,540 --> 00:06:11,740
I'm so excited.

98
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:13,500
Riding the bus with you,

99
00:06:13,980 --> 00:06:15,080
eating meals with you,

100
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:18,040
taking a bath together...

101
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,326
Let's actually focus on studying, okay?

102
00:06:20,350 --> 00:06:23,330
I will, but just being with you, Hioki,

103
00:06:23,820 --> 00:06:25,020
is more than enough for me.

104
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,370
Looks like we're in for another

105
00:06:28,410 --> 00:06:31,530
unforgettable trip this year.

106
00:06:31,830 --> 00:06:33,190
Though we really do need to study.

107
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:32,900
"School Trip: Joined a Group I'm Not Close to Season2"

108
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:36,940
(Study Camp: Episode 1)

109
00:07:49,963 --> 00:07:52,545
(Watarai: Good morning, Hioki.)

110
00:07:52,570 --> 00:07:56,120
(You doing okay? Is your bag heavy?)

111
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:58,430
(Want me to meet you at the school gate?)

112
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:02,200
He makes such a big deal out of everything.

113
00:08:04,500 --> 00:08:05,890
Hioki!

114
00:08:11,260 --> 00:08:13,220
Didn't you pack way too much?

115
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:14,880
This is so heavy.

116
00:08:15,170 --> 00:08:16,290
My shoulders are killing me.

117
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:20,910
Hey, hands off!

118
00:08:21,100 --> 00:08:25,060
This bag is packed with
vitamins and my mom's love...

119
00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:26,110
Hioki.

120
00:08:27,660 --> 00:08:29,360
I told you I'd come meet you.

121
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:31,650
Let me carry that.

122
00:08:31,860 --> 00:08:33,069
No, no, I've got it.

123
00:08:33,070 --> 00:08:34,860
- It's no trouble at all. - Thanks.

124
00:08:35,110 --> 00:08:35,820
What about me?

125
00:08:35,950 --> 00:08:38,466
- Let me take your backpack, too.
- No, really, I can carry it.

126
00:08:38,490 --> 00:08:39,490
Hey!

127
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,499
Over here!

128
00:08:41,500 --> 00:08:42,790
- Let's go. - Okay.

129
00:08:44,246 --> 00:08:45,246
What about me...

130
00:08:46,620 --> 00:08:47,880
- I'm so excited. - Me too.

131
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:50,630
Hey there, morning!

132
00:08:52,010 --> 00:08:54,200
By the way, do we have
assigned seats on the bus?

133
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:57,809
I think we can sit wherever we want...

134
00:08:57,810 --> 00:09:00,580
- Hioki, let's sit together.
- Oh, sure.

135
00:09:01,820 --> 00:09:02,820
Too bad!

136
00:09:03,180 --> 00:09:05,300
- Hioki's coming with us. - Huh?

137
00:09:05,390 --> 00:09:07,530
We're taking different
buses depending on our class.

138
00:09:08,210 --> 00:09:11,189
- Hioki's on our bus. - Oh, I see.

139
00:09:11,190 --> 00:09:12,690
- Come on, let's go. - Oh, right.

140
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,340
Oh, Hioki.

141
00:09:16,780 --> 00:09:18,020
I'll see you when we get there.

142
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:20,490
- Yeah.
- Let's go.

143
00:09:24,140 --> 00:09:26,040
- Let's head over, too.
- Yeah.

144
00:09:45,390 --> 00:09:48,180
Time for Tsujitani's big question!

145
00:09:49,220 --> 00:09:50,780
So, how are things going lately?

146
00:09:51,260 --> 00:09:52,300
Everything going smoothly?

147
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,320
Smoothly with what?

148
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:55,570
Come on, you know what.

149
00:09:56,300 --> 00:09:57,300
With your boyfriend!

150
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:59,296
Whoa, where is this
coming from all of a sudden?

151
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:01,560
You can't have a school
trip without a little love talk!

152
00:10:02,180 --> 00:10:03,480
Any relationship troubles?

153
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,469
Nope, nothing in particular.

154
00:10:06,470 --> 00:10:07,916
Everything's pretty
much the same as always.

155
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:09,990
But you're in different classes now, right?

156
00:10:11,020 --> 00:10:12,380
Doesn't it make you feel insecure?

157
00:10:13,220 --> 00:10:14,250
Well...

158
00:10:14,850 --> 00:10:15,850
Of course it does.

159
00:10:16,140 --> 00:10:17,526
Honestly, I'm nothing but insecure.

160
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:18,580
Why?

161
00:10:19,130 --> 00:10:21,376
Aren't you guys together pretty
much every second outside of class?

162
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,500
Well, yeah, that's true.

163
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,720
But that's nowhere near enough.

164
00:10:25,730 --> 00:10:28,710
Even if we were glued to
each other 365 days a year,

165
00:10:30,140 --> 00:10:31,206
it still wouldn't be enough for me.

166
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:32,660
Man, you're greedy.

167
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:35,900
Oh, what about texting and calling?

168
00:10:36,020 --> 00:10:38,230
Oh, we talk every day.

169
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:40,700
Though I'm always the
one reaching out first.

170
00:10:42,780 --> 00:10:43,780
So yeah,

171
00:10:43,990 --> 00:10:46,820
we don't really have any major issues...

172
00:10:46,950 --> 00:10:49,390
You're being way too naive, Hioki.

173
00:10:49,580 --> 00:10:50,580
Huh?

174
00:10:50,740 --> 00:10:53,920
Getting together isn't the
finish line in a relationship.

175
00:10:56,940 --> 00:10:58,240
True.

176
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:01,200
It's what comes after that really counts...

177
00:11:01,460 --> 00:11:02,550
Exactly!

178
00:11:02,750 --> 00:11:05,710
You can't just let your guard down
because the feelings are mutual.

179
00:11:06,900 --> 00:11:07,900
For all you know,

180
00:11:08,510 --> 00:11:10,350
he might actually be
super insecure deep down.

181
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,400
You really think so?

182
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:34,880
Hioki!

183
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:39,250
How are you holding up? Are you tired?

184
00:11:39,290 --> 00:11:40,680
No, I'm fine.

185
00:11:44,970 --> 00:11:48,499
Watarai can definitely be a
little overprotective, though...

186
00:11:48,500 --> 00:11:49,540
Here, I've got this.

187
00:11:49,970 --> 00:11:51,390
- Thanks.
- Sure.

188
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:54,150
- Which one's better, that one or this one?
- This one.

189
00:11:55,510 --> 00:11:56,520
Hey, guys,

190
00:11:56,850 --> 00:11:59,480
- let's take a picture here, too!
- Yeah, let's do it.

191
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:00,960
- You two get in here, too. - Sure!

192
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,860
Right here! Come on, get in!

193
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,860
Alright, taking it now!

194
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,860
Say "Gorgonzola cheese"!

195
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:10,840
You really love your cheese, huh?

196
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,410
Let me see, let me see!

197
00:12:12,780 --> 00:12:14,740
- Let's take one with just the two of us.
- Okay.

198
00:12:15,620 --> 00:12:16,896
Looks like it's a little too bright.

199
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:17,990
Too bright, huh?

200
00:12:18,540 --> 00:12:19,910
Wanna take another one?

201
00:12:19,950 --> 00:12:21,370
Okay, say cheese.

202
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:26,920
So cute.

203
00:12:29,700 --> 00:12:33,400
He doesn't really seem all
that insecure to me, does he?

204
00:12:33,790 --> 00:12:34,790
Let's go.

205
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:38,600
This really brings back memories.

206
00:12:38,640 --> 00:12:39,640
Yeah, it does.

207
00:12:40,020 --> 00:12:41,420
I'm really looking forward to this.

208
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:45,330
Yeah, I'm pretty sure
everything's fine right now...

209
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:49,430
Hey, mind if I post that photo
from earlier on Instagram?

210
00:12:50,030 --> 00:12:50,440
Sure,

211
00:12:50,530 --> 00:12:51,530
go ahead.

212
00:12:51,650 --> 00:12:53,290
Make sure you cover Hioki's face, though.

213
00:12:53,990 --> 00:12:55,480
Huh? Why?

214
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:57,320
Because...

215
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,470
Hioki's way too cute.

216
00:12:59,780 --> 00:13:01,500
I don't want anyone else seeing him.

217
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:03,400
Besides,

218
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:06,600
it'd be bad news if another
guy like me noticed him.

219
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:20,010
- Hioki-kun?
- Yes?

220
00:13:20,180 --> 00:13:23,310
Um, would it be okay if
we took a picture together?

221
00:13:23,350 --> 00:13:26,590
Huh? Oh, you mean with Watarai?

222
00:13:26,940 --> 00:13:29,230
No, I was hoping to take
one with you, Hioki-kun.

223
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,640
Wait, with me?

224
00:13:31,450 --> 00:13:32,960
Okay, ready?

225
00:13:35,130 --> 00:13:37,449
Alright, say cheese!

226
00:13:37,450 --> 00:13:38,450
Hold on.

227
00:13:39,980 --> 00:13:40,980
If you want a picture,

228
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:42,440
why not take it with me instead?

229
00:13:51,630 --> 00:13:55,170
- I'm so jealous.
- Lucky him.

230
00:13:58,580 --> 00:14:00,270
Seriously, what was that back there?

231
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,320
Nothing.

232
00:14:03,900 --> 00:14:04,820
I was just messing around.

233
00:14:04,890 --> 00:14:07,010
Yeah, right. You were totally jealous.

234
00:14:07,390 --> 00:14:09,640
Does it bother you that much
when Hioki gets attention?

235
00:14:10,900 --> 00:14:12,100
It's not that I hate it.

236
00:14:13,980 --> 00:14:15,830
I know I'm being completely
unreasonable here,

237
00:14:17,180 --> 00:14:19,420
but I want to be the only
one who's allowed to like you.

238
00:14:21,010 --> 00:14:22,010
For that matter,

239
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:24,750
you need to be more careful, Hioki.

240
00:14:26,180 --> 00:14:27,180
Me?

241
00:14:27,380 --> 00:14:29,090
You leave yourself way too open.

242
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:30,530
Your guard is always down.

243
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:33,330
You need to realize just
how cute you actually are.

244
00:14:36,210 --> 00:14:37,030
Right, got it.

245
00:14:37,210 --> 00:14:41,090
Anyway, once we get inside,
don't leave my side for a second.

246
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:44,800
Okay.

247
00:15:00,700 --> 00:15:01,910
Morning radio exercises?

248
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,380
No way...

249
00:15:07,260 --> 00:15:09,660
(Kazamino High School Study Camp Schedule)

250
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,000
Oh, I get it.

251
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:15,090
Bath and meal times are split up by class.

252
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,600
Which means...

253
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:20,340
You two are on completely
different schedules!

254
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:25,560
Look at Watarai, he
looks completely crushed.

255
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,440
Are you okay?

256
00:15:31,980 --> 00:15:33,180
Not even a little bit.

257
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:37,800
Don't talk to anyone else
for the rest of the trip, Hioki.

258
00:15:38,170 --> 00:15:40,370
That might be a little
tough to pull off...

259
00:15:45,820 --> 00:15:47,020
But I'll do my best.

260
00:15:48,950 --> 00:15:49,950
Thank you.

261
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:05,380
Watarai...

262
00:16:05,630 --> 00:16:07,500
He looked so bummed out earlier.

263
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:12,210
Alright, let's take a
quick break, everyone.

264
00:16:12,550 --> 00:16:15,050
If you need to use the restroom, go now.

265
00:16:16,850 --> 00:16:17,700
Excuse me, sir?

266
00:16:17,770 --> 00:16:19,660
Do we really have to turn this in?

267
00:16:19,710 --> 00:16:21,790
- You bet you do!
- Whoa, intense.

268
00:16:21,870 --> 00:16:23,700
- Obviously!
- Talk about pressure.

269
00:16:23,980 --> 00:16:24,980
Still,

270
00:16:25,780 --> 00:16:27,870
why is he feeling so insecure?

271
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:37,720
There's no way I'm finishing all this.

272
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:40,920
Huh? Where'd Hioki go?

273
00:16:42,570 --> 00:16:44,010
Probably the restroom.

274
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:53,250
It's not like my feelings are going
to change just because we're apart.

275
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,799
That's why it's really stressing me out.

276
00:17:00,800 --> 00:17:02,809
Yeah, if my boyfriend acted
like that, it'd definitely hurt a little.

277
00:17:02,810 --> 00:17:08,510
Right? It feels so one-sided. I'm always
the one going to see him or texting first.

278
00:17:09,140 --> 00:17:11,530
Plus, he never says "I love
you" or anything like that.

279
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:14,230
It makes me wonder if
he even likes me at all,

280
00:17:14,590 --> 00:17:15,890
and I get super insecure.

281
00:17:17,020 --> 00:17:18,120
Wait, could it be...

282
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:22,590
The reason Watarai's so insecure...

283
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:24,860
is because of me?

284
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:41,200
What's wrong?

285
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:43,470
You've been spacing out this whole time.

286
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:44,560
It's nothing...

287
00:17:48,440 --> 00:17:49,440
Oh, shoot!

288
00:17:49,940 --> 00:17:50,940
What's up?

289
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,100
I left my clothes back in the room.

290
00:17:54,570 --> 00:17:55,570
Huh?

291
00:17:56,180 --> 00:17:57,376
Your shirt, or your tracksuit?

292
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:58,400
Both of them.

293
00:17:58,650 --> 00:17:59,990
Are you serious?

294
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:02,220
Man, you've gotta be kidding me.

295
00:18:03,500 --> 00:18:04,500
Well, then...

296
00:18:05,620 --> 00:18:07,680
Here, wear mine.

297
00:18:07,700 --> 00:18:08,710
Are you sure?

298
00:18:10,780 --> 00:18:13,310
Tsujitani, the greatest man alive!

299
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:22,110
- Thanks.
- Anytime.

300
00:18:24,350 --> 00:18:26,260
No, wait a second.

301
00:18:27,140 --> 00:18:29,170
If Watarai finds out about this...

302
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:31,306
Actually, I shouldn't. I
don't want to trouble you.

303
00:18:31,330 --> 00:18:33,849
- Don't be shy, take it!
- No, really, I'm fine!

304
00:18:33,850 --> 00:18:36,109
Put this on and cheer up!

305
00:18:36,110 --> 00:18:37,110
Really, I'm okay!

306
00:18:37,780 --> 00:18:39,110
What's your deal, Hioki?

307
00:18:41,500 --> 00:18:42,700
Wait, don't tell me...

308
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,159
- Did you gain weight?
- No!

309
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:45,280
Too big for my size now?

310
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:47,330
- That's not it!
- Sorry I didn't notice.

311
00:18:47,740 --> 00:18:50,950
Then what is it? Too good to wear
the clothes of a mere mortal like me?

312
00:18:51,380 --> 00:18:53,676
You get a little popular and
suddenly you're too good for us!

313
00:18:53,700 --> 00:18:55,200
Man...

314
00:18:57,180 --> 00:18:59,230
That hurts my feelings.

315
00:18:59,550 --> 00:19:02,020
- I told you that's not it!
- I'm heartbroken.

316
00:19:02,050 --> 00:19:04,590
- Come on, it's not like that!
- So heartbroken.

317
00:19:12,630 --> 00:19:15,810
I'm only wearing it until I
get back to my room anyway.

318
00:19:15,890 --> 00:19:19,059
As long as Watarai
doesn't see me, it'll be fine...

319
00:19:19,060 --> 00:19:20,070
Hioki.

320
00:19:25,820 --> 00:19:27,610
Oh, I'm gonna head back first!

321
00:19:28,060 --> 00:19:29,820
- I'll take your stuff for you.
- Hey, wait!

322
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:31,450
Take your time, you two!

323
00:19:38,060 --> 00:19:39,060
What are you doing?

324
00:19:40,490 --> 00:19:41,490
Nothing...

325
00:19:51,360 --> 00:19:52,360
I'm so dead.

326
00:19:56,100 --> 00:19:57,820
- What's the meaning of this?
- Uh, well...

327
00:19:58,260 --> 00:19:59,580
I forgot my clothes in my room...

328
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,790
I tried to turn him down, though!

329
00:20:04,820 --> 00:20:07,020
I'll change out of it the
second I get back to my room.

330
00:20:14,280 --> 00:20:15,280
I'm sorry.

331
00:20:17,260 --> 00:20:18,260
Are you mad at me?

332
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,240
Come here.

333
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:27,700
Wait a sec...

334
00:20:39,420 --> 00:20:40,420
Watarai.

335
00:20:42,260 --> 00:20:43,260
Take it off.

336
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:49,080
Uh... well...

337
00:20:50,420 --> 00:20:51,420
Don't tell me...

338
00:20:52,760 --> 00:20:54,160
Are you wearing nothing underneath?

339
00:21:04,420 --> 00:21:06,340
You really have zero
sense of self-preservation.

340
00:21:08,980 --> 00:21:09,980
I'm sorry.

341
00:21:13,580 --> 00:21:14,580
Hioki.

342
00:21:15,470 --> 00:21:17,710
Do you have any idea how
much I've been holding back?

343
00:21:18,970 --> 00:21:19,970
Huh?

344
00:21:50,550 --> 00:21:51,550
But...

345
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:56,240
I don't have to hold back anymore, do I?

346
00:22:13,020 --> 00:22:14,330
Wait a minute!

347
00:22:18,760 --> 00:22:19,820
I can't wait.

348
00:22:25,660 --> 00:22:26,760
I'm your boyfriend,

349
00:22:28,200 --> 00:22:29,960
so I can do whatever
I want with you, right?

350
00:22:37,840 --> 00:22:40,550
On the very first day of study camp,

351
00:22:42,780 --> 00:22:43,780
somehow,

352
00:22:44,020 --> 00:22:46,510
things completely spiraled out of control.

353
00:22:50,520 --> 00:22:52,180
(Next Episode) I like you, Watarai.

354
00:22:52,350 --> 00:22:54,550
(Camp: Day 2) This feeling
really brings back memories.

355
00:22:54,950 --> 00:22:55,840
(First Birthday Together)

356
00:22:55,841 --> 00:22:56,980
Happy birthday.

357
00:22:57,760 --> 00:22:58,860
More than I ever imagined,

358
00:22:59,240 --> 00:23:00,690
such happy moments.

359
00:23:02,080 --> 00:23:03,900
Huh? Tsukasa?

360
00:23:05,200 --> 00:23:06,370
Say cheese.

361
00:23:06,570 --> 00:23:07,590
Hioki.
